# Swiss product UI

PermitPilot is unofficial. Keep Geist, italic Fraunces for accent words, Swiss red, product green, and the warm paper palette. Do not copy admin.ch (coat of arms, Frutiger, mandatory red header bar).

## Tokens

- Controls and interactive surfaces: `--radius: 12px`. Compact chips: `--radius-sm: 8px`.
- Paper is warm off-white (`#f7f5f2`), ink is near-black without an olive cast. Dark theme is warm charcoal, not olive-black.
- Interactive rows may use a faint fill (`--selected-fill`, `--hover`) plus radius. How, sources, history, legal, and result sections stay open — do not wrap them in cards.
- Motion: `color`, `background`, `border`, and `box-shadow` at `--ease` (about 200ms). Gate with `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Wizard step change: remount `.wizard-card` and play a short directional `transform` + opacity enter (`wizard-enter-forward` / `wizard-enter-back`). Answers may stagger in. No hover-lift. Reduced motion already disables animation.
- Site wash: one `body::before` layer using `--bg-glow-a` / `--bg-glow-b` (Swiss red and green, low opacity). Animate only `transform`. Recolor via tokens in dark mode. Do not add extra blobs on cards or sections, `backdrop-filter`, hover-lifts, glass pills, neon-on-dark, or 17–30px radii.
- Theme: `data-theme="light|dark"` on `html`. Default mode is `auto` (system `prefers-color-scheme`). Recolor via tokens, not extra cards or neon-on-dark.

## Type

- Body/UI: Geist. Hero accent (`em`): Fraunces italic.
- Eyebrows, kickers, and chips are sentence case with normal tracking. Do not restore uppercase + wide letter-spacing.
- Headlines stay large; keep `letter-spacing` around `-0.04em`.

## Layout

- Wizard answers are a single-column radio list (`fieldset` + rounded rows). Height follows the label and hint. No `min-height` tiles, mint badges, or corner arrows.
- Selected answer: faint red fill and a filled radio — not a second card border or a left rule as the only signal.
- Semantic left rules only for real status (alerts, disclaimer).
- Small chips (history kind, actor tag) are allowed. Full-width rounded tiles are not.

```css
/* ❌ BAD */
.choice { min-height: 210px; border-radius: 22px; box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(0,0,0,.07); }
.eyebrow { text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .17em; }

/* ✅ GOOD */
.choice { padding: 14px; border-radius: var(--radius); }
.choice.selected { background: var(--selected-fill); }
.eyebrow { color: var(--red-dark); font-weight: 650; }
```
